orelse whose fallback is itself optional in the source.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
schema: {
	a?: string
	b?: string
}
-- ship/1.0.thema --
schema: {
	c: string
}

forward: {
	c: orelse(input.a, input.b)
}
-- out/error --
b is optional in 0.0, so it cannot be orelse's fallback: the fallback must always exist:
    1.0.thema:6:21
